<title>BELGIUM: EU to discuss sugar supplies to remote regions.</title>
<headline>EU to discuss sugar supplies to remote regions.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Wednesday discuss sugar supplies for remote regions, EU member state officials said.</p>
<p>The discussion will cover supplies to the Azores, Canary Islands and Aegean islands.</p>
<p>A decision on supply arrangements is expected next week.</p>
</text>
